# Entity icons (mdi)

Pick icons by the physical quantity an entity represents, not just "electricity-ish":

- `mdi:flash` — instantaneous power entities, unit **W** (e.g. a power sensor, a target-watts number).
- `mdi:lightning-bolt` — cumulative energy entities, unit **kWh** (e.g. a total-energy sensor).

A Watts-unit entity must never get `mdi:lightning-bolt`, and vice versa. Applies to all device types in `custom_components/powerbaas`, not just Boiler Controller.
